S,mmm → 秒\n   例如：\n   00:00:02,375 → 2.375\n\n2. 使用 25 帧对齐：\n   - 1 帧 = 0.04 秒\n   - 帧数 = round(秒 ÷ 0.04)\n   - 最终时间 = 帧数 × 0.04\n\n3. 保留两位小数\n\n【示例时间对齐】\n- 0.208 → 0.20\n- 2.375 → 2.36\n- 2.791 → 2.80\n- 4.333 → 4.32\n\n【输出格式】\nstart-end#英文翻译\n\n【输出要求】\n- 每条字幕输出一行\n- 用 \"-\" 连接时间\n- \"#\" 后不加空格\n- 不要输出序号\n- 不要输出中文\n- 不要解释\n- 不要输出空行\n- 只输出最终结果\n\n【示例】\n输入：\n00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:02,375\n什么意思\n输出：\n0.20-2.36#What do you mean.\n\n【现在开始处理以下内容】\n{{在这里粘贴 SRT 字幕}}", "one by one", 24, 1024, 333651695646501, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 18, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 19, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 136, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offloa